<title>INDIA: India WPI inflation rises 6.88 pct yr/yr in week.</title>
<headline>India WPI inflation rises 6.88 pct yr/yr in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 6.88 percent in the week ending Dec 7 from 6.80 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES    Dec 7, 1996  Nov 30, 1996  Dec 9, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.88	  +6.80	   +6.5</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  318.6	  318.8	   298.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended Dec 9, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
